# UiCopy.kt accessors: one line per `val Name get() = text("key")`, or `FN name template param` for a
# parameterized `fun name(param: String) = text(template)`. dsl/ui-copy-accessors.mjs reads this file plus
# courses-biome/pl-ru/uiCopy.core-data and courses-biome/en-ru/uiCopy.core-data and prints UiCopy.kt.
# `# comment` lines directly above an entry (no blank line between) become its KDoc.
#
# Name            key                              [PARTIAL]
# PARTIAL means the key only has to exist in at least one pack, not both.

